      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Task 1 — Ingest  (15 min)\n\n- Load 10 docs (copy paste facts)\n- RecursiveCharTextSplitter\n  chunk_size=200, overlap=20\n- SentenceTransformer embed\n  all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n- Persist to Chroma\n- Print chunk count",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "72A6QJlCI6DhRzLZUVFQs",
      "originalText": "Task 1 — Ingest  (15 min)\n\n- Load 10 docs (copy paste facts)\n- RecursiveCharTextSplitter\n  chunk_size=200, overlap=20\n- SentenceTransformer embed\n  all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n- Persist to Chroma\n- Print chunk count",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
