      "text": "Task 3 — Memory Chain  (20 min)\n\n- ChatPromptTemplate with\n  MessagesPlaceholder history\n- Add {context} slot for RAG\n- Pipe  prompt | llm | parser\n- Wrap with\n  RunnableWithMessageHistory\n- get_session_history fn",
